    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"letting go\" sounds nice in theory but it feels so scary. like, if i actually let go of everything... everything i am... what's actually left? it feels like there's nothing left to be. just an empty shell. does it ever really feel like there's a way to just... stop the noise and not have to struggle anymore?",
